  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring Eyesight to Children in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eyes of Africa&apos;s purpose is to sight screen and identify children in need of eye care and to promote the importance of eye health and protection in some of Africa&apos;s most vulnerable communities. The importance of a child&apos;s vision cannot be underestimated as it affects every part of their everyday life. Addressing visual impairment at a young age will assist the child to become productive independent members of their communities and society at large.</narrative>
  </description>
